# Scraped prospect assets — 84MB of other people's images. The ones a preview
# actually uses are copied into preview/public/clients/, and the rest can be
# regenerated with research/tools/scrape.py. The page text and index.json ARE
# tracked: they are the evidence behind every claim in a client file.
research/*/assets/

# Wrangler local deploy state (account id, project name, build cache).
# Not secret, but machine-local — the OAuth token itself lives outside the repo.
.wrangler/

# Derived photograph ladder (preview/scripts/derive-photos.mjs). Regenerated from
# the committed originals on every build — 311 WebP files that would otherwise
# churn in the diff every time a photograph is swapped. The MANIFEST beside them
# (preview/src/data/photo-manifest.json) IS committed: the typecheck and the test
# suite read it, and both run before the build that would regenerate it.
preview/public/d/
